# The R5 sea sample (batch 1): an og.Water raised by a 9 m/s wind
# (og.Water.wind, Gerstner waves) under the physical sky, with five buoys
# a system floats on og.physics.waterHeight each tick: the tick's own sea,
# the surface the renderer draws. tests/evidence/r5-water/NOTES.md has the
# commands and what each frame shows.
name "R5 sea"
id "r5-sea"
engine "0.7.7"
entry "src/main.ts"
profile "3d"
tick 60
seed 1
